## Acceptance criteria

- The two existing emblems glow without replacing or redrawing the approved mark.
- Localized warm/rose halos, not opaque pane backgrounds or whole-door illumination.
- Neon stays under glass reflections and moves with each door.
- No flicker, new animation loop, interaction target or sound behavior.
- OPEN plaque, cord, signboard, room geometry and all other artwork remain unchanged.
- Skip, keyboard entry, blocked audio, reduced motion, forced colours and no-JS stay safe.
- No image viewing or claim of owner visual acceptance.

